  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/H-SJ3eKdhSA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/H-SJ3eKdhSA</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H-SJ3eKdhSA&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dPqXaA/hyJXUt77SC/p5Q1ldrUVKnmbRid5OZyI1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H-SJ3eKdhSA\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>영상 함께 보고(영상을 꽤 진지하게 보더라구요. ) 부연 설명 좀 하구요.</p><p>4가지 카드 만들기 활동 중 하나를 선택해서 하도록 안내했습니다.</p><p>내용 안에 실천할 것 3가지를 적고 일주일 동안 점검할 수 있는 점검표를 그려넣고&#160;</p><p>오늘부터 일주일 간 실천해보고 다음 주 같은 요일에 함께 돌아보기를 하기로 하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/902dfcddf120192b5b2c6ee6b21cbcaae2457385\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/902dfcddf120192b5b2c6ee6b21cbcaae2457385\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c681ef7fd75fddc2a55a8458b662f2ce0d3096c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c681ef7fd75fddc2a55a8458b662f2ce0d3096c3\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0bcf46681202672059f1fab74c7ea73fa3d307d6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0bcf46681202672059f1fab74c7ea73fa3d307d6\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d030e149f046a0b8091ccd8ecced1f924e5df86\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d030e149f046a0b8091ccd8ecced1f924e5df86\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9fb0b534f2d9019bd584ced1d3321dabf1ac6fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9fb0b534f2d9019bd584ced1d3321dabf1ac6fc\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b52de5a38d6140e2bf7d9e106f31953995d09eaf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b52de5a38d6140e2bf7d9e106f31953995d09eaf\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3beb6f99e0f742322e684a52c0cea973c1324305\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3beb6f99e0f742322e684a52c0cea973c1324305\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>비슷한 내용으로 다른 학년(3학년)은 원격 수업이라 지구 온난화 관련하여 수업한 내용 돌아보고</p><p>활동 안내하고 포스터나 카드 만들기를 하도록 한 후 밴드에 사진을 올리라고 해서 결과를 받아보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f56cb96752896328784c4fe68180767af54ca2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f56cb96752896328784c4fe68180767af54ca2\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ab6ded09509063abe16845632cb19171a3ba8a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ab6ded09509063abe16845632cb19171a3ba8a7\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d0ae1226d1b4a5c53ea7ad5577421428e8a377b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d0ae1226d1b4a5c53ea7ad5577421428e8a377b\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2a3fd1d5c1c8f3bbc308654ee7213f572709df0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2a3fd1d5c1c8f3bbc308654ee7213f572709df0\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03e33633f58f2a16049cef93b0836b42f69d50c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03e33633f58f2a16049cef93b0836b42f69d50c\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"h